---
layout: base.njk
documentTitle: "DJ Pardis – Pop house . West Coast . Booking worldwide"
description: DJ Pardis is a pop house DJ on the West Coast, booking worldwide for corporate events, conferences, gallery openings, and themed parties.
bodyClass: page-home
---
<div class="fold">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="container hero__inner">
    <div class="hero__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow hero__status">Currently booking</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title" class="wordmark-display">
        <span class="wordmark-display__line">DJ</span>
        <span class="wordmark-display__line"><span class="hl">PARDIS</span></span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero__tagline"><span class="hl-pink">Pop house</span> · West Coast · Booking worldwide</p>
      <div class="hero__cta-bar">
        <nav class="hero__socials" aria-label="Social">
          <ul>
          <li class="hero__socials-item hero__socials-item--instagram">
            <a href="{{ site.socials.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram">
              <span class="hero__socials-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" focusable="false">
                  <path
                    fill="currentColor"
                    d="M12 0C8.74 0 8.333.015 7.053.072 5.775.132 4.905.333 4.14.63c-.789.306-1.459.717-2.126 1.384S.935 3.35.63 4.14C.333 4.905.131 5.775.072 7.053.012 8.333 0 8.74 0 12s.015 3.667.072 4.947c.06 1.277.261 2.148.558 2.913.306.788.717 1.459 1.384 2.126.667.666 1.336 1.079 2.126 1.384.766.296 1.636.499 2.913.558C8.333 23.988 8.74 24 12 24s3.667-.015 4.947-.072c1.277-.06 2.148-.262 2.913-.558.788-.306 1.459-.718 2.126-1.384.666-.667 1.079-1.335 1.384-2.126.296-.765.499-1.636.558-2.913.06-1.28.072-1.687.072-4.947s-.015-3.667-.072-4.947c-.06-1.277-.262-2.149-.558-2.913-.306-.788-.718-1.459-1.384-2.126C21.319 1.347 20.651.935 19.86.63c-.765-.297-1.636-.499-2.913-.558C15.667.012 15.26 0 12 0zm0 2.16c3.203 0 3.585.016 4.85.071 1.17.055 1.805.249 2.234.413.562.217.96.478 1.378.896.419.42.679.819.896 1.378.164.429.358 1.066.413 2.234.056 1.266.07 1.646.07 4.85s-.015 3.585-.07 4.85c-.055 1.17-.249 1.805-.413 2.234-.217.562-.479.96-.897 1.378-.419.418-.818.679-1.378.896-.428.164-1.065.358-2.234.413-1.266.056-1.646.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.015-4.85-.07-1.17-.055-1.805-.25-2.234-.413-.569-.224-.96-.479-1.379-.897-.421-.419-.69-.818-.9-1.378-.165-.429-.359-1.066-.413-2.234-.057-1.266-.07-1.646-.07-4.85 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.85.055-1.17.25-1.805.413-2.234.224-.569.48-.96.9-1.379.419-.421.75-.69 1.379-.9.428-.164 1.066-.357 2.23-.413 1.266-.057 1.646-.07 4.85-.07zm0 3.678a6.162 6.162 0 100 12.324 6.162 6.162 0 000-12.324zM12 16a4 4 0 110-8 4 4 0 010 8zm7.806-11.845a1.44 1.44 0 11.001 2.881 1.44 1.44 0 000-2.881z"
                  />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="hero__socials-label">Instagram</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="hero__socials-item hero__socials-item--spotify">
            <a href="{{ site.socials.spotify }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Spotify">
              <span class="hero__socials-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" focusable="false">
                  <path
                    fill="currentColor"
                    d="M12 0a12 12 0 100 24 12 12 0 000-24zm5.52 17.31a.75.75 0 01-1.03.25c-2.82-1.72-6.37-2.11-10.55-1.15a.75.75 0 11-.34-1.46c4.58-1.05 8.51-.6 11.67 1.33.35.21.47.68.25 1.03zm1.47-3.27a.94.94 0 01-1.29.31c-3.23-1.99-8.15-2.56-11.97-1.4a.94.94 0 11-.55-1.8c4.36-1.32 9.78-.68 13.5 1.6.44.27.58.85.31 1.29zm.13-3.4C15.25 8.34 8.85 8.13 5.15 9.25a1.13 1.13 0 11-.66-2.16c4.24-1.29 11.32-1.04 15.78 1.61a1.13 1.13 0 01-1.15 1.94z"
                  />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="hero__socials-label">Spotify</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="hero__socials-item hero__socials-item--apple-music">
            <a href="{{ site.socials.appleMusic }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Apple Music">
              <span class="hero__socials-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" focusable="false">
                  <path
                    fill="currentColor"
                    d="M19.8 3.24c-.17-1.05-.99-1.87-2.04-2.04C15.98.9 8.02.9 6.24 1.2 5.19 1.37 4.37 2.19 4.2 3.24 3.9 5.02 3.9 18.98 4.2 20.76c.17 1.05.99 1.87 2.04 2.04 1.78.3 9.74.3 11.52 0 1.05-.17 1.87-.99 2.04-2.04.3-1.78.3-15.74 0-17.52zM16.7 7.8v7.18c0 1.5-1.3 2.26-2.58 2.26-1.12 0-2.05-.58-2.05-1.55 0-1.18 1.16-1.77 2.47-1.77.33 0 .63.04.87.12V9.88l-5.2 1.05v5.5c0 1.5-1.29 2.26-2.58 2.26-1.12 0-2.05-.58-2.05-1.55 0-1.18 1.16-1.77 2.47-1.77.33 0 .63.04.87.12V8.6c0-.42.29-.79.7-.87l6.23-1.26c.44-.09.85.25.85.7v.63z"
                  />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="hero__socials-label">Apple Music</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="hero__socials-item hero__socials-item--soundcloud">
            <a href="{{ site.socials.soundcloud }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer" aria-label="SoundCloud">
              <span class="hero__socials-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" focusable="false">
                  <rect fill="currentColor" x="2" y="11" width="2.6" height="7" rx="0.65" />
                  <rect fill="currentColor" x="6.2" y="8" width="2.6" height="13" rx="0.65" />
                  <rect fill="currentColor" x="10.4" y="5" width="2.6" height="16" rx="0.65" />
                  <rect fill="currentColor" x="14.6" y="9" width="2.6" height="12" rx="0.65" />
                  <rect fill="currentColor" x="18.8" y="12" width="2.6" height="6" rx="0.65" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="hero__socials-label">SoundCloud</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="hero__socials-item hero__socials-item--mixcloud">
            <a href="{{ site.socials.mixcloud }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Mixcloud">
              <span class="hero__socials-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" focusable="false">
                  <path
                    fill="currentColor"
                    d="M4.5 14.25C4.5 10.8 7.3 8.25 10.75 8.25c.65 0 1.28.12 1.87.35A5.25 5.25 0 0117.5 6a5.26 5.26 0 015.25 5.25v.75H4.5v-2.75z"
                  />
                  <rect fill="currentColor" x="2" y="15.5" width="2.75" height="5" rx="0.5" />
                  <rect fill="currentColor" x="6.25" y="15.5" width="2.75" height="7" rx="0.5" />
                  <rect fill="currentColor" x="10.5" y="15.5" width="2.75" height="4.5" rx="0.5" />
                  <rect fill="currentColor" x="14.75" y="15.5" width="2.75" height="6.25" rx="0.5" />
                  <rect fill="currentColor" x="19" y="15.5" width="3" height="3.5" rx="0.5" />
                </svg>
              </span>
              <span class="hero__socials-label">Mixcloud</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/book/">Check dates <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero__media">
      <img
        src="{{ site.hero.photo }}"
        alt="{{ site.hero.alt }}"
        width="800"
        height="519"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
        fetchpriority="high"
      />
      <figcaption>{{ site.hero.credit }}</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="marquee__track">
    {% for i in range(0, 2) %}
      <span class="marquee__item">Pop house</span>
      <span class="marquee__item"><span class="dot"></span></span>
      <span class="marquee__item marquee__item--alt">West Coast</span>
      <span class="marquee__item"><span class="dot"></span></span>
      <span class="marquee__item">Booking worldwide</span>
      <span class="marquee__item"><span class="dot"></span></span>
      <span class="marquee__item marquee__item--alt">DJ Pardis</span>
      <span class="marquee__item"><span class="dot"></span></span>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
</div>

<section class="section section--pad-lg" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-label">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-label" id="about-label">// <span class="section-label__num">01</span> About</h2>
      <span class="section-head__meta">Est. 2017 · San Francisco</span>
    </header>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-body">
        <p class="about-lead">Hey, this is <span class="hl">DJ Pardis</span>!</p>
        <p>
          I started DJing in May 2017 and played
          <a href="https://vimeo.com/463652373" rel="noopener">themed Tea Time tunes</a>
          at <span class="hl-pink">Twitter HQ</span>. I usually DJed with
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/juliengaillard1/" rel="noopener">Julien Gaillard</a>
          on the
          <a href="https://vimeo.com/463687716" rel="noopener">guitar</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          In the summer of 2019, I was the tour DJ for
          <a href="https://soundcloud.com/ohsimsimah" rel="noopener">Sim Simah</a>
          and
          <a href="https://music.apple.com/us/artist/aarxn-cxle/1453179768" rel="noopener">Aarxn Cxle</a>.
          The picture is by
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/meria.agency/" rel="noopener">Jesse Meria</a>
          from July 2019 at
          <a href="https://www.thenewparish.com/" rel="noopener">The New Parish</a>,
          where we were
          <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20191023073406/https://www.teamllfent.com/news/2019/7/30/camron-with-special-guest-troyllf" rel="noopener"><span class="hl">the opening act</span></a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <dl class="about-rail" aria-label="Quick facts">
        <div>
          <dt>Location</dt>
          <dd>West Coast · Booking worldwide</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Sound</dt>
          <dd>Pop house . Dance pop . Downtempo</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Plays well at</dt>
          <dd>Company events · Conferences · Gallery openings · Theme nights · Product launches · Fundraisers</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>Follow me</dt>
          <dd>
            <a href="{{ site.socials.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">IG</a> .
            <a href="{{ site.socials.spotify }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">Spotify</a> .
            <a href="{{ site.socials.appleMusic }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">Apple</a> .
            <a href="{{ site.socials.soundcloud }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">SoundCloud</a> .
            <a href="{{ site.socials.mixcloud }}" target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">Mixcloud</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sand" id="gigs" aria-labelledby="gigs-label">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-label" id="gigs-label">// <span class="section-label__num">02</span> Gigs</h2>
      <span class="section-head__meta">Schedule</span>
    </header>
    {% set upcoming = gigs | upcomingGigs %}
    {% if upcoming and upcoming.length %}
      <ul class="gigs-list">
        {% for gig in upcoming %}
          <li class="gig">
            <span class="gig__date">{{ gig.date | shortDate }}</span>
            <span class="gig__venue">{{ gig.venue }}</span>
            <span class="gig__city">{{ gig.city }}</span>
            {% if gig.url %}
              <a class="gig__link" href="{{ gig.url }}" rel="noopener" aria-label="More info on {{ gig.venue }}">→</a>
            {% endif %}
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% else %}
      <div class="upcoming-block">
        <h3 class="upcoming-block__headline">Next date <span class="hl-pink">TBA</span>.<br />Book your next event.</h3>
        <div class="upcoming-block__body">
          <p>Whether it's conferences, gallery openings, or product launches, tell us the date, the vibe, and the location, and we'll be there.</p>
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg upcoming-block__cta" href="/book/">Check dates <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--pad-lg" id="listen" aria-labelledby="listen-label">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-label" id="listen-label">// <span class="section-label__num">03</span> Listen</h2>
      <span class="section-head__meta">Mixtapes · {{ mixtapes.length }} years</span>
    </header>

    <div class="mixtapes-head">
      <h3>Annual mixtapes</h3>
      <span class="meta mixtapes-head__meta">
        One for every year, {{ mixtapes[mixtapes.length - 1].year }}–{{ mixtapes[0].year }}
        <span class="mixtapes-head__sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a class="mixtapes-head__feed" href="/mixtapes/">All mixtapes</a>
        <span class="mixtapes-head__sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <a class="mixtapes-head__feed" href="/feed.xml">Subscribe (RSS)</a>
      </span>
    </div>
    <ul class="mixtapes-grid">
      {% for m in mixtapes | sortMixtapesDesc %}
        <li>
          <a class="mixtape-tile {% if loop.first %}mixtape-tile--latest{% endif %}" href="{{ m.url }}" rel="noopener">
            {% if loop.first %}<span class="mixtape-tile__badge">Latest</span>{% endif %}
            <span class="mixtape-tile__year">{{ m.year }}</span>
            <span class="mixtape-tile__title">{{ m.title }}</span>
            <span class="mixtape-tile__date">{{ m.date }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

{% if radio and radio.length %}
<section class="section section--sand" id="radio" aria-labelledby="radio-label">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-label" id="radio-label">// Radio</h2>
      <span class="section-head__meta">Guest spots · bff.fm</span>
    </header>
    <ul class="radio-list">
      {% for r in radio %}
        <li class="radio-item">
          <span class="radio-item__ep">Ep. {{ r.episode }} · {{ r.show }}</span>
          <a class="radio-item__title" href="{{ r.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ r.title }}</a>
          <div class="radio-item__meta">
            <span>with <a href="{{ r.withUrl }}" rel="noopener">{{ r.with }}</a></span>
            <span>·</span>
            <span><a href="{{ r.showUrl }}" rel="noopener">{{ r.show }}</a></span>
            <span>·</span>
            <span>{{ r.date }}</span>
          </div>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if gallery and gallery.length %}
<section class="section section--pad-lg" id="gallery" aria-labelledby="gallery-label">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-label" id="gallery-label">// <span class="section-label__num">04</span> Gallery</h2>
      <span class="section-head__meta">Posters · flyers · ephemera</span>
    </header>

    {% if gallery.length == 1 %}
      {% set g = gallery[0] %}
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <figure class="feature-grid__media">
          <img src="{{ g.src }}" alt="{{ g.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        </figure>
        <div class="feature-grid__copy">
          <span class="feature-grid__label">// Poster</span>
          <h3 class="feature-grid__title">Bay to Breakers 2019</h3>
          <p>Sunday May 19th, 8am start. Music by DJ Pardis &amp; Pupusa Papi. A full morning of bottle-fueled dance pop and hip hop through the streets of San Francisco.</p>
          <dl class="feature-grid__meta">
            <div><dt>Designer</dt><dd>Regy Augustin</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Date</dt><dd>May 19, 2019</dd></div>
            <div><dt>City</dt><dd>San Francisco, CA</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <ul class="gallery-grid">
        {% for g in gallery %}
          <li class="gallery-item">
            <figure>
              <img src="{{ g.src }}" alt="{{ g.alt }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              {% if g.caption %}<figcaption>{{ g.caption }}</figcaption>{% endif %}
            </figure>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if press and press.length %}
<section class="section section--sand" id="press" aria-labelledby="press-label">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-label" id="press-label">// Press</h2>
    </header>
    <ul class="press-list">
      {% for p in press %}
        <li class="pull-quote">
          <blockquote>"{{ p.quote }}"</blockquote>
          <cite class="meta">— {% if p.url %}<a href="{{ p.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ p.source }}</a>{% else %}{{ p.source }}{% endif %}{% if p.date %} · {{ p.date }}{% endif %}</cite>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="cta-band" aria-labelledby="cta-label">
  <div class="container cta-band__inner">
    <h2 class="cta-band__title" id="cta-label">Let's make your <span class="hl">event</span> sound awesome.</h2>
    <div class="cta-band__aside">
      <p>Planning a company event, conference, gallery opening, or themed party? Send the date, vibe, location, and guest count, and we'll take it from there.</p>
      <div class="cta-band__actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/book/">Check dates <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
